            <ArticleTitle>'Bittarella massiliensis' gen. nov., sp. nov. isolated by culturomics from the gut of a healthy 28-year-old man.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-29</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.nmni.2016.12.014</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report here the main features of the proposed new bacterial genus Bittarella. The type strain 'Bittarella massiliensis' GD6T (CSUR P2149) was isolated from a stool sample from a healthy French man.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
